  "html": "<div class=\"fx-section\" style=\"padding-top:45px\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-2\"><h1 style=\"text-align: left;text-transform: uppercase\">Herzlich willkommen auf unserer Website!</h1>\n<h2><strong>Wofür steht Flat-XP?</strong></h2>\n<p>Flat-XP steht für „wonderful e<strong>XP</strong>erience – eine wundervolle Erfahrung“ .</p>\n<p>Bei einem Training in 2001 begegnete ich einer schwarzen Schönheit, elegant, freundlich und schnell – das war Karah vom Retrieverzwinger. Und wie es das Schicksal so wollte, hatte Ingrid Grill im April 2001 einen Wurf und im Juni zog Undine bei uns ein und veränderte unser Leben nachhaltig.</p>\n<div class=\"fx-boxes\"><a class=\"fx-box\" href=\"http://www.retrieverclub.at/cms/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/06/icon1-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>ÖRC, Österr. Retrieverclub</span></a><a class=\"fx-box\" href=\"http://www.flatcoated-retriever-society.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/06/icon2-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>FLATCOATED RETRIEVER SOCIETY</span></a><a class=\"fx-box\" href=\"http://www.oekv.at/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/06/icon4-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Österreichischer Kynologenverband</span></a><a class=\"fx-box\" href=\"http://www.fci.be/de/Nomenclature/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/06/icon3-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>FCI</span></a><a class=\"fx-box\" href=\"http://www.champdogs.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/06/icon5-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Champdogs</span></a></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-2\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"fx-slider\"><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-3.jpg\" alt=\"Dummytraining\"><figcaption>Dummytraining 2017</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Jagdliches Training</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-1.jpg\" alt=\"Astrid und Rio\"><figcaption>Alpha Orion aus unserm A-Wurf-2</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-2.jpg\" alt=\"Zuchtgruppe CSS 2010\"><figcaption>zuchtgruppe</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Unser B-Wurf entwickelt sich prächtig</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-5.jpg\" alt=\"Maya -\"><figcaption>Unser C-Wurf (Maya)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-6-e1508948168602.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Unser D-Wurf</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fx-slide\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/main-slide-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Welpentreffen 2010</figcaption></figure><div class=\"fx-dots\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t\n</div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><div class=\"fx-title fx-title--underline\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center\">NEWS</h2></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><!--NEWS--></div></div></div>"
